    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always had a deep appreciation for mathematics, especially as a creative tool. It’s not just about formulas—it’s about patterns, logic, and solving real-world problems. I enjoy how it connects to art and design, and I find it calming to work through problems step by step. In Naples, where life moves at a steady pace, math gives me a sense of order and clarity.",
