    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used an AI-powered app last year to review algebra concepts. It walked me through problems with clear explanations and visual aids. I especially liked how it adapted to my mistakes and offered alternative ways to solve equations. It felt like a helpful tutor, not a replacement. It made learning more interactive and less intimidating, especially when I was studying on my own.",
